        "id": 11059
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-11-16T16:45:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`c` is a vector of int32 (the type is `I32`) where each 32-bit group should be either 0 or ~0.\n\n`if_then_else` should be implementable as `return (t \u0026 c) | (f \u0026 ~c)`. I\u0027m not familiar enough with AVX-512 to be confident if your implementation is better or worse than this, but it\u0027s a shame that `_mm512_blendv_ps` does not exist. What does the codegen look like for yours vs the bitmasking way?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 338,
        "startChar": 9,
        "endLine": 338,
        "endChar": 53
      },
      "revId": "c059a40961fddb2ca1004ca735d0e4673d7db67f",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "6cf3abf6_3c414a6e",
        "filename": "src/opts/SkRasterPipeline_opts.h",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 338,
      "author": {
        "id": 21839
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-11-26T07:08:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "For the blend implementation, using x86 MSVC v19.latest compiler, the code generation is as follows:\n        mov     eax, -2147483648\n        vpbroadcastd zmm3, eax\n        vpandd  zmm0, zmm0, zmm3\n        vptestmd k1, zmm0, zmm0\n        vblendmps zmm0 {k1}, zmm2, zmm1\n        ret     0\nFor the bitmasking way, the code generation is:\n        vpandnd zmm2, zmm0, zmm2\n        vpandd  zmm0, zmm1, zmm0\n        vpord   zmm0, zmm0, zmm2\n        ret     0\nThe method using bitmasking requires fewer cycles compared to the blend implementation. I conducted tests on various workloads and observed no significant difference in terms of performance.\nI found out we can use the ternarylogic avx512 instruction \"vpternlogq zmm0, zmm1, zmm2, 202\" to replace the three bitmask instructions.",
      "parentUuid": "1b8ee916_cf5e1223",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 338,
        "startChar": 9,
        "endLine": 338,
        "endChar": 53
      },
      "revId": "c059a40961fddb2ca1004ca735d0e4673d7db67f",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
